or Manufacturing Continuity</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"prose max-w-none text-gray-700 space-y-6\">\n                    <p>\n                        Kheda district serves as a vital industrial connector between Ahmedabad and Vadodara, hosting a diverse range of industries from textiles in <b>Nadiad</b> to engineering in <b>Matar</b> and food processing in <b>Kapadvanj</b>. Finding a reliable <b>Panel AC service Kheda</b> provider is essential to keep your production lines running smoothly. The electrical control panels in these units are the nerve centers of operation, and overheating is the primary cause of component failure.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        Our specialized <b>industrial panel AC repair</b> services are tailored for the Kheda region. Whether you operate <b>Rittal</b> cooling units in Kamla GIDC, <b>Adhunik</b> enclosure coolers in Mahemdavad, or <b>Advance Cooling Systems</b> in Kathlal, our technicians have the expertise to diagnose and fix thermal issues rapidly. We ensure your VFDs, PLCs, and servo drives are kept at optimal temperatures to prevent tripping.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        At <a href=\"/\"><b>Atlas Aircon</b></a>, we provide comprehensive <b>Panel AC service Kheda</b> solutions. From routine filter cleaning to complex <b>compressor replacements</b> and <b>gas charging</b>, we serve the industrial backbone of Nadiad and surrounding areas with professionalism and speed.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/panel-ac-repair-service.webp\" alt=\"Industrial Panel AC service Kheda technical diagnostics\" class=\"rounded-2xl shadow-2xl w-full border-2 border-gray-100\" title=\"\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Specialized Application Section -->\n        <section class=\"mb-20 bg-white p-10 rounded-3xl shadow-lg border-l-8 border-primary\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-8\">Kheda Industrial Expertise</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-center\">\n                <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Atlas-Aircon-Panel-Ac-3.png\" alt=\"Engineering Industry Panel AC service Nadiad\" class=\"w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-xl mb-4\" title=\"\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-primary\">General Engineering</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Cooling for CNC/VMC panels in Nadiad GIDC (Kamla). We prevent thermal tripping in machining centers.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Walkin-Freezer-Repair-Service.webp\" alt=\"Food Processing Panel AC service Kheda\" class=\"w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-xl mb-4\" title=\"\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-primary\">Food Processing</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Hygiene-compliant cooling for food units in Matar and Kapadvanj. We service SS304 units for washdown areas.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rittal-panel-ac-service.webp\" alt=\"Textile Industry Panel AC service Kheda\" class=\"w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-xl mb-4\" title=\"\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-primary\">Textiles &#038; Plastics</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Managing heat loads in injection molding and textile panels. Expert filter maintenance for dust control.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Pros and Cons -->\n        <section class=\"mb-20\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold section-title\">7 Major Pros and Cons of Industrial Service</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\n                <div class=\"p-8 bg-green-50 rounded-2xl border border-green-200\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-green-700\">Advantages (Pros)</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-4 text-sm\">\n                        <li><b>Production Uptime:</b> Regular <b>Panel AC service Kheda</b> minimizes machine downtime due to overheating.</li>\n                        <li><b>Component Life:</b> Extends the lifespan of expensive PLCs and drives in your control panels.</li>\n                        <li><b>Energy Savings:</b> Clean coils and fans reduce the power consumption of your cooling units.</li>\n                        <li><b>Dust Protection:</b> Frequent cleaning is vital in dusty industrial environments like GIDC Kamla.</li>\n                        <li><b>IP Integrity:</b> We replace gaskets to maintain the dust-proof rating of your enclosures.</li>\n                        <li><b>Fire Safety:</b> Reduces the risk of electrical fires caused by overheated components.</li>\n                        <li><b>Audit Compliance:</b> Documented service helps in quality and safety audits.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-8 bg-red-50 rounded-2xl border border-red-200\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-red-700\">Neglect Risks (Cons)</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-4 text-sm\">\n                        <li><b>Unexpected Shutdowns:</b> A thermal trip can stop an entire production line in Matar.</li>\n                        <li><b>Electronics Failure:</b> Heat is the number one enemy of sensitive electronic controllers.</li>\n                        <li><b>Higher Power Bills:</b> Clogged filters force the AC to work harder, increasing energy costs.</li>\n                        <li><b>Compressor Damage:</b> Lack of maintenance leads to expensive compressor replacements.</li>\n                        <li><b>Logic Errors:</b> Overheating can cause data corruption in automation systems.</li>\n                        <li><b>Warranty Issues:</b> Manufacturers may void warranties if units are not serviced.</li>\n                        <li><b>Emergency Costs:</b> Urgent repairs in remote areas cost more than scheduled maintenance.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Brands We Service -->\n        <section class=\"mb-20\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold section-title\">Leading Industrial Brands Supported</h2>\n            <p class=\"mb-10 text-gray-600\">We specialize in a massive array of global and Indian brands. We use only high-grade spares and do not claim to be authorized service providers, allowing us to provide faster, more cost-effective solutions for the Kheda industrial belt.</p>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"p-4 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg text-center font-bold hover:shadow-md transition\">Rittal</div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg text-center font-bold hover:shadow-md transition\">Adhunik</div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg text-center font-bold hover:shadow-md transition\">Advance Cooling</div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg text-center font-bold hover:shadow-md transition\">Hoffman</div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg text-center font-bold hover:shadow-md transition\">Schneider</div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg text-center font-bold hover:shadow-md transition\">Pfannenberg</div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg text-center font-bold hover:shadow-md transition\">Cosmotec</div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg text-center font-bold hover:shadow-md transition\">Daikin</div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg text-center font-bold hover:shadow-md transition\">Mitsubishi</div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg text-center font-bold hover:shadow-md transition\">Blue Star</div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg text-center font-bold hover:shadow-md transition\">Seifert</div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg text-center font-bold hover:shadow-md transition\">Voltas</div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Pricing Table -->\n        <section class=\"mb-20 bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border-t-8 border-secondary\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-center\">Kheda Service &#038; Spares Price List (2026)</h2>\n            <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n                <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse\">\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr class=\"bg-gray-100\">\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border\">Item Description</th>\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border\">Estimated Price (INR)</th>\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border\">Grade</th>\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border\">Action</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><b>General Service (Nadiad/Matar)</b></td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹1,800</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">Industrial Wash</td>\n                            <td class=\"